      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Based on the psychological testing of spinal patients the authors regard a possibility of the use of these methods in clinical practice, study the self-estimation of the health status, the intensity of chronic pain. Strong correlations are noted in the self-estimation of the life quality and choice of affective descriptors. A list of the most frequently used semantic descriptors is provided."},
